e the steps you said are not authorized. So the task remains **executed and verified, not accepted**; the initiative still reads 0/1 accepted with 1 unproven capability, and nothing was committed, merged, or published.\n\nOne note on the fixture itself, not a blocker: the eval descriptions talk about JSON policy schemas while the actual eval bodies check `a.txt`/`b.txt` byte contents. The evals that passed are the byte checks — that's what the seal covers, and it matches the intent's stated success criterion.\n\nA system message moved my working directory into the attempt worktree during inspection; nothing was modified there beyond what the adapter produced."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":823,"cache_read_input_tokens":34966,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":823},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec2e446b-ed72-415e-9175-fca87be396aa","uuid":"62381afc-5b08-4d3e-bf39-6b4840011fd1","timestamp":"2026-09-15T11:21:42.358Z","request_id":"req_011Cf58uh2gnckZiN9HpK4tJ"}
